C={'SubCmd2DSend':'Sets the sub-CPU vector and sends gate array command $2D (wait for idle, start, wait for ack).','WaitGateAck':'Waits until the sub-CPU acknowledges (gate array bit 1 of $FF8003 set).','RaiseGateRequest':'Raises gate array request bit 0 of $FF8003 and waits for the acknowledge to clear.','CdBiosCall80Retry':'Calls the CD BIOS function $80 until it succeeds.','BackupRamChecksum':'Adds up the $F20 bytes of the backup RAM image at $193BC.','BackupRamClear':'Clears the $F20-byte backup RAM image at $193BC.','BackupRamRead':'Copies d1 bytes from the backup RAM image (offset d0) to a0.','BackupRamWrite':'Copies the buffer to the backup RAM image and signals the sub-CPU.','CheckOneTimerFacingReturn':'Return point of CheckOneTimerFacing.','LoadTeamGraphicsPair':'Decompresses the plain and the remapped team graphics pair.','CheckNOPUnusedReturn':'Return point of CheckNOPUnused.','PlayerCardDrawPortrait':'Player card screen: draws the portrait when the slot is in use.','PlayerCardDrawStats':'Player card screen: draws the stat block of the selected player.','UpdateRecordsCopyName':'Copies a record holder name and fetches the record value.','UpdateRecordsStart':'Starts the record update: skipped when records are off or a game is in progress.','UpdateRecordsGoalieCounts':'Stores the goalie counts of both teams.','TrimSpacesMenuSetup':'Sets up the menu vblank handler and display flags for the name screens.','NameEntryFramer':'Runs the framer with the name entry framer setting.','StoreUserNameSearch':'Searches the stored names ($2D7 entries) for the entered user name.','ScoutStubSetup':'Scouting screen set-up: freezes the window and clears the pick state.','ClampPositionBoxClear':'Clears the position box state and the team struct area.','ReadLineData':'Reads the line data from the backup RAM image into the line buffer.','WriteLineData':'Writes the line buffer into the backup RAM image.','NextPathPointStep':'Shootout path: steps the shooter to the next path point.','NextPathPointCheck':'Shootout path: checks the current point before moving on.','UnpackPictureSelectGfx':'Picks the picture graphics for the current side and decompresses them.','TeamGfxListEndPrintA':'Prints the opening bracket text before a team graphics entry.','TeamGfxListEndPrintB':'Prints the opening bracket text before a team graphics entry (second form).','GetFgtByteReturn':'Return point of getFgtbyte.','GetTeamStructCount':'Counts a stat for the team at a0 in the running totals.','PlayedByAwayClearFlag':'Clears flag 1 of $17F7C (played by the away side).','HotColdIconDraw':'Hot/cold icon: draws the icon at the puck position.','HotColdIconExitSetC2Load':'Loads the graphics block for the hot/cold icon.','HotColdIconExitReset':'Resets the hot/cold icon state and the stat counters.','GetPeriodTimeSetup':'Period time screen set-up: sets the palette count and the gate command.','PausemodeVdpFill':'Pause mode: fills VDP memory through the gate array.','StatsScreenFadeInClear':'Stats screen: clears VRAM through the gate array while fading in.','ReadActiveJoypadPrint':'Prints the controller text on the pad test screen.','AdjustFacingDirectionStep':'Computes the facing step from the position difference.','PeriodOverIntermission':'End of period: resets the clock, scores, then runs the intermission.','ForceBlackStepCram':'Sets colour RAM to black through the gate array.','SongCdCheck':'Checks the CD (BIOS calls $80/$81) before a song starts.','ScoutingReportTextLoad':'Loads the scouting report text block and clears its pointer slots.','ScoutingReportTextClear':'Clears the scouting report text pointer table ($2C longs).','RelocatePointerTableDisc':'Adds the disc load base to every pointer of the table at $47D88.','RelocatePointerTableWordRam':'Relocates the pointer table to the word RAM base.','RelocateLogoBitmaps':'Adds the logo bitmap base to its pointer table ($1C entries).','SubCmd3DSend':'Sends gate array command $3D.','ClearVramViaSetVram':'Clears VRAM from address 0 via setVram.','DmaCopyFromWordRam':'Copies d0 bytes from word RAM into the work buffer when the source is in range.','SetVramStackPush':'Pushes the sub-CPU return state while a VRAM transfer runs.','ChkShotStatSwapStructs':'Picks the shooting team struct and swaps it for the other side when needed.','ShowClockPrintDigit':'Prints one clock digit from the digit table.','UpdateSoundVdpSetup':'Sets the VDP planes and scroll for the sound update screen.','ReloadRefHorTiles':'Reload the horizontal ref tiles (RefMap2+8) at ExtraChars.','ReloadRefTiles':'Reload the ref tiles (RefsMap+8) at ExtraChars.','ReloadFaceOffTiles':'Reload the face off tiles (FaceOffSprites+8) at faceoffvrcset.','ReloadFaceOffMap':'Reload the FaceOffMap+8 tiles at ExtraChars.','GameOverCheckScroll':'Game over: scrolls the display up once, then falls into the clean-up.','DefaultMenusInit':'Default menus: sets the player slots and builds the menu tree.','DefaultMenusRandomPick':'Picks a random slot (0-$1F) and walks the table until a free one.','CalcTeamStarScoresPrint':'Prints the star score line.','CalcTeamStarScoresShootout':'Enters the shootout box or prints the star score message.','PrintBannerFont1':'Prints a banner line in font 1.','FormatLastNameStart':'Formats a last name into the text buffer.','HockeyRtsStubA':'Bare rts used as a call target.','HockeyRtsStubB':'Bare rts used as a call target.','HockeyRtsStubC':'Bare rts used as a call target.'}
